#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-AD0492 expect=noViolation domain=ADLBC
#note "DISCRIMINATING-adjacent. No SHIFT column at all; the tuple y=1 is still seeded by BASECAT1. WildcardExpander SYNTHESISES the unmatched pattern's concrete name SHIFT1 as an absent column, so an expansion EXISTS and the rule EXECUTES - var_exists(SHIFT1) is then false and it stays silent. Must be noViolation, not skipped: skipped would hide a broken synthesis step."
#library standard=adamig version=1-3
dataset ADLBC
col STUDYID  type=Char
col USUBJID  type=Char
col PARAMCD  type=Char
col BASECAT1 type=Char
---
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1015 | ALT | LOW
